changeSet.comment:
Ticket: LF-0080. Platform-wide email provider configuration and delivery logs for Super Admin Email & Delivery.
Secrets live only in ProtectedPassword (Data Protection ciphertext). Index review: PK_EmailProviderConfigurations;
UX_EmailProviderConfigurations_IsActive one active row; IX_EmailDeliveryLogs_CreatedAtUtc for recent lists;
IX_EmailDeliveryLogs_Status_CreatedAtUtc for filtered admin logs; UX_EmailDeliveryLogs_IdempotencyKey for duplicate prevention;
IX_EmailDeliveryLogs_TenantId_CreatedAtUtc for tenant-scoped queries. Performance note: workers read the single active
configuration row; log queries are bounded by page size and status/date filters.
